              77                     !
              78                     !fong01
              79                     ! incorporate a delta-function adjustment to account for the forward
              80                     ! diffraction  peak in the context of the two stream approximations.
              81                     ! w1(n),  w(n), and tau(n+1) are the adjusted parameters.
              82                     !
